{
  "hadith_number": 40,
  "text": "On your authority of the Son of Umar, make a laby pleased of them both, who said, the messenger of Allah made a blessings and peace of Allah be upon him. Took me by the shoulder and said, be in the world as they you are a stranger or a waith error. The Son of Umar made a laby pleased of them both, used to say, at evening do not expect to live till morning and at morning do not expect to live till evening. Take from your health, for your illness and for your life, for your death. It was related by Al-Bukhari.",
